cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use refbook in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "refbook: a catalog of human reference genome editions"
abstract: >-
  A catalog of the many published versions of the human reference genome,
  each described as a recipe applied to the original deposited sequences
  and verified by rebuilding the published file. In addition to the catalog
  itself, refbook provides utilities to search, identify, compare, fetch, and
  reconstruct any sequence or edition. These are exposed as a Python library
  and command line tool with a Rust core, as well as a web application
  (WebAssembly and TypeScript).
